  m_Name: Dialogue_Ch3_6_Critic
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Zmywak.Narrative::Zmywak.Narrative.Dialogue.DialogueGraph
  startNodeId: cr_1
  nodes:
  - nodeId: cr_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Wtorek wiecz\xF3r. Siobh\xE1n wpada do kuchni blada jak talerz."
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: Table seven. That's your woman from the Irish Times. The food critic. I'd know her anywhere.
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Right. Nobody panics. Nobody. Gavin, the lamb. Kooba...
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - seven
    - critic
    - anywhere
    - panics
    - lamb
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_your_man
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch3_at_board
    branchNodeId: cr_board
    nextNodeId: cr_sink
  - nodeId: cr_board
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: ...brunoise for the soup. Three millimetres. Like Thursday.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Jak w czwartek. Palce zgi\u0119te jak pazury, ostrze prowadzi k\u0142ykie\u0107. Trzy milimetry."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cr_crash
  - nodeId: cr_sink
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: ...plates. Hot plates, clean plates, all night. You're the engine, Kooba.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Silnik. Pierwszy raz kto\u015B nazwa\u0142 zmywaka silnikiem. Syzyf by si\u0119 u\u015Bmiechn\u0105\u0142."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - engine
    - hot
    - night
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cr_crash
  - nodeId: cr_crash
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Za dwadzie\u015Bcia dziewi\u0105ta. Gavin chwyta rondel z sosem bez \u015Bcierki i syczy przez z\u0119by. R\u0119ka czerwona, sos na pod\u0142odze, jagni\u0119cina dla stolika siedem za cztery minuty."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Banjaxed. My hand's banjaxed.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - hand
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_banjaxed
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: Rzucam swoje i pomagam Gavinowi.
      targetNodeId: cr_help
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Pilnuj\u0119 swojej roboty. Declan jest blisko."
      targetNodeId: cr_own
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: cr_help
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Zimna woda na r\u0119k\u0119 Gavina, czysty rondel, \u015Bcierka. Kuba podaje, Gavin jedn\u0105 r\u0119k\u0105 ko\u0144czy sos. Trzy minuty pi\u0119\u0107dziesi\u0105t sekund."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: ...Cheers, Kooba. Don't tell anyone.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - cheers
    - tell
    - anyone
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_helped_gavin
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: -5
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cr_end
  - nodeId: cr_own
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Declan sam \u0142apie rondel. Klnie po irlandzku, kt\xF3rego Kuba nie zna, ale rozumie ka\u017Cde s\u0142owo. Jagni\u0119cina wychodzi minut\u0119 za p\xF3\u017Ano."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Zrobi\u0142em swoje. Czy to wystarczy? W kuchni chyba nigdy nie wystarcza."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cr_end
  - nodeId: cr_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Czwartek. Recenzja w \"The Irish Times\": \"a quietly confident kitchen\", cztery gwiazdki na pi\u0119\u0107. Declan przypina wycinek nad wydawk\u0105, obok grafiku."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Four stars. The whole city's eating out these days, Kooba. Money everywhere. Watch this place grow.
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Not bad. For a charity.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Gavin si\u0119 u\u015Bmiecha. Nie do mnie, ale te\u017C nie przeciwko mnie. Trzy tygodnie temu nie zna\u0142em tu nikogo. Dzi\u015B znam ludzi, kt\xF3rzy prawie wiedz\u0105, jak mam na imi\u0119."
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Koniec Rozdzia\u0142u 3: Swoi i obcy."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - stars
    - city
    - eating
    - money
    - grow
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: -5
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
